  "job_B20.8_20260920_210356": {
    "chunk_text": "Her is seo endebyrdnes monan gonges, & s\u00e6 flodes. On \u00f0reora nihta ealdne monan wana\u00f0 se s\u00e6flod, o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t se mona bi\u00f0 XI nihta eald, o\u00fe\u00fee XII. Of XI nihta ealdum monan weaxe\u00f0 se s\u00e6flod o\u00fe XVIII nihta ealdum monan. Fram XVIII nihta ealdum monan wana\u00fe se s\u00e6flod o\u00fe XXVI nihta ealdum monan. Of XXVI nihta ealdum monan weaxe\u00f0 se s\u00e6flod o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t se mona bi\u00f0 eft \u00f0reora nihta eald..",
